e origin and Earth is located at 1 AU radially. [32] Our modulation model simply assumes that within the confines of the well-defined rope, there is a substantial switch in the dominant sunward diffusion mode for the GCR. In the ambient solar wind, inward diffusion is predominantly along the Parker spiral lines. Inside the rope, there is no easy connection to the outer heliosphere, as can be seen qualitatively in Figure 5. Instead, particles must diffuse inward across field lines. The radial direction, convective diffusive balance for Compton Getting factor C and effective diffusion coefficient, $K_{\perp}$ is $$
